  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would like to have these available to the animator to use with assets. Such as having them fade in based on the distance you are away from the base avatar if the ear muff status is true and you are outside of the radius/entering the radius.\n\nThis would be a great feature for avatar creators to create things like ear plugs, headphones, etc that dynamically update based on if the person is close enough to hear you or not.",
